doctype html
html(lang="ja")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1")
    title 400 Bad Request | CULTURE LOG
    link(rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2285%22>📚</text></svg>")
    link(href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet")
    link(href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet")
    style.
      .code-num {
        font-size: 5.5rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }
      .caution-tape {
        background: repeating-linear-gradient(
          -45deg,
          #212529,
          #212529 12px,
          #ffc107 12px,
          #ffc107 24px
        );
        height: 14px;
      }

  body.min-vh-100.d-flex.align-items-center(
    data-bs-theme=currentTheme
    class=currentTheme === 'light' ? 'bg-warning bg-gradient' : ''
  )
    .container.py-5
      .row.justify-content-center
        .col-md-8.col-lg-6
          .card.shadow-lg.border-0.overflow-hidden
            //- 立ち入り禁止テープ風装飾
            .caution-tape

            .card-body.p-5.text-center
              span.badge.bg-dark.text-warning.border.border-warning.border-opacity-50.mb-3.px-3.py-2
                i.bi.bi-exclamation-triangle-fill.me-1
                | STAFF ONLY / 関係者以外立入禁止

              .code-num.mb-2(class=currentTheme === 'light' ? 'text-dark' : 'text-warning') 400
              h2.h4.fw-bold.mb-3 そのリクエスト方法は未対応です。

              p.text-body-secondary.mb-4
                | 映写室への勝手な侵入（#{method || '不正な'} メソッド）はご遠慮ください。

              .d-grid
                a.btn.btn-lg.rounded-pill.fw-bold(
                  href="/posts"
                  class=currentTheme === 'light' ? 'btn-dark' : 'btn-warning'
                )
                  i.bi.bi-ticket-perforated.me-2
                  | ロビー（CULTURE LOG）へ戻る

            .caution-tape